  "job_B3.2.17_20261117_183401": {
    "chunk_text": "hta\u00fe Godes folc \u00dea deman beo\u00fe swi\u00feor to herigenne \u00feonne to leanne; for\u00feon hi willa\u00fe styran \u00fe\u00e6m ungelyfedum \u00dea deman beo\u00fe on Godes fultome \u00e6ghw\u00e6r, ge \u00fe\u00e6t hie him selfum heora synna bebeorga\u00fe, ge eac o\u00fere For\u00feon on domes d\u00e6g hi beo\u00fe from Gode \u00feysne cwide geherende \u00fee he cwi\u00fe: \u00feu goda \u00feeow, & \u00feu \u00deonne sceal ure anra gehwylc beran his d\u00e6da beforan Cristes heahsettle, & ealra his haligra, & \u00feonne Manige men wena\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t mor\u00feor sy seo m\u00e6ste synne. Ac us is to witenne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fereora cynna syndon mor\u00feras, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t man to o\u00ferum Swi\u00fee seldon \u00e6nig man wile beon andetta \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6festig sy, o\u00fe\u00fee t\u00e6lend. Se mon se \u00fee o\u00feerne acwel\u00fe, & inst\u00e6pes hine sylfne ongyte\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t he mycel man & myccle synne Witodlice \u00fea \u00e6fstigan men, & \u00fea t\u00e6lendan, \u00feeh hi syn \u00fe\u00e6s mor\u00feres scyldige, hi hit him to nanre synne \u00dea \u00e6fstigan, \u00feeah hi syn dea\u00fees scyldige, hie heora scylda ne ongyta\u00fe; for\u00feon \u00fee hie n\u00e6fre \u00deeo dea\u00feberende uncyst us is eallum to onscunienne, \u00fee l\u00e6s hi us besencean on helle grund. Cu\u00felice \u00fe\u00e6t wuldor \u00feysses middangeardes is sceort & gewitende; Drihtnes wuldor \u00feonne,",
